{"reviewId": "254854030_87y5zSfsb", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "在现代长波衰退期里通货膨胀从来不是单一因素造成的，而是实物层面的资源不够用和货币层面的钱发太多共同推动的，资源约束是通胀的基本面基础，信用膨胀是通胀的货币点火器，两者缺一不可，只有当资源供给出现紧张、形成真正的资源约束时，物价才有上涨的客观条件，而只有当信用持续扩张、市场上的货币不断增多时，需求和购买力才能把资源价格真正推上去，形成大范围、持续的通货膨胀，如果只有资源约束而没有信用膨胀，钱不够多，价格很难大幅上涨，如果只有信用膨胀而没有资源约束，产能充足、供给充裕，多发的货币也很难转化为全面的物价上涨，只会变成资产泡沫，所以近两次长波衰退里出现的严重通胀，比如20世纪70年代的大通胀，本质上都是资源约束和信用膨胀同时共振的结果。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "资源约束与信用膨胀是导致通货膨胀的两个基本原因", "range": "5175-5198", "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "254854030_87y5zSfsb", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773308466, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 19, "likes": [{"userVid": 347026738, "name": "Stays", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lWfF1X3ty2bg47DYg6VFTbcm25CgibmTAlNxJuWuPzjYqEmbXJVMpxetVBkjhFk8YxqID6Y15SLZycMzSWicmoPtNMqQB9mZuCs6ydNJArMnc/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-50", "desc